      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds good to me. Would it look roughly like this?\n\n```json\n{\n  \"Name\": \"J12\",\n  \"Type\": \"Port\",\n  \"FormFactor\": \"Ext Port\",\n  \"Pinout\": [\n    { \"Type\": \"Bus\", \"Name\": \"I2C\", \"Protocol\": \"I2C\", \"Segment\": \"I2C12.1\" },\n    { \"Type\": \"Bus\", \"Name\": \"USB\", \"Protocol\": \"USB 2.0\", \"Segment\": \"B.1\" }\n  ]\n},\n{\n  \"Name\": \"J13\",\n  \"Type\": \"Port\",\n  \"FormFactor\": \"Ext Port\",\n  \"Pinout\": [\n    { \"Type\": \"Bus\", \"Name\": \"I2C\", \"Protocol\": \"I2C\", \"Segment\": \"I2C12.2\" },\n    { \"Type\": \"Bus\", \"Name\": \"USB\", \"Protocol\": \"USB 2.0\", \"Segment\": \"B.2\" }\n  ]\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "631bcc19_b86346a6",
